Checks that 'ValidSDKs' survives a YAML -> YAML round trip, i.e. that
parseAndDumpAPINotes does not silently drop the key or any of its entries.

RUN: apinotes-test %S/Inputs/ValidSDKs/multiple-sdks/AgingLib.apinotes | FileCheck %s

CHECK:      Name:{{ +}}AgingLib
CHECK:      ValidSDKs:
CHECK-NEXT: {{ +}}- Name:{{ +}}iphoneos
CHECK-NEXT: {{ +}}ValidUntil:{{ +}}12.0
CHECK-NEXT: {{ +}}- Name:{{ +}}macosx
CHECK-NEXT: {{ +}}ValidUntil:{{ +}}15.0

The rest of the file must still round trip -- a malformed ValidSDKs mapping
would otherwise swallow the following keys.

CHECK:      Functions:
CHECK-NEXT: {{ +}}- Name:{{ +}}aged_out_function
